    { "a": "MICE", "t": "overfit", "aka": ["multiple imputation by chained equations", "chained equations", "fully conditional specification", "FCS", "sequential regression multivariate imputation", "SRMI"], "q": "Model each column from the rest, cycle, do it m times. The clever pick nearly everyone makes." },
